From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:16:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: enable the Neural Engine

Enable the five ANE power states, the three ANE DARTs and the ANE on the
J604. The driver's T8132 platform is identify_only: with a boot loader
that hands over the ANE preload (memory-region, memory-region-names and
apple,firmware-iovas) it identifies the preload and stops before
power-up; without one it logs that the preload was not handed off and
stops. Neither path powers or boots the engine. A qualification run
selects the power-up at runtime by reloading ane_t6021 with
h16_power_unqualified=1 (and h16_preload_digest while the preload rule
has no pinned digest); a reboot returns to identify_only.

The DARTs probe (and reset) with the ANE_SYS power state on, as they do
on SoCs whose ANE is enabled.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index 4e6135cece..be0892e107 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -1059,3 +1059,46 @@
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+/*
+ * The Neural Engine. The T8132 platform is identify_only: the driver reads
+ * the preload m1n1 hands over and stops before power-up, unless
+ * ane_t6021.h16_power_unqualified=1 is given (a qualification run, a module
+ * reload at runtime). Without the hand-over it logs that and stops. The ANE
+ * power states and DARTs probe either way.
+ */
+&ps_ane_sys {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_ane_mpm {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_ane_cpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_ane_td {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_ane_base {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ane_dart0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ane_dart1 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ane_dart2 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ane {
+	status = "okay";
+};
